 interfered with mouse in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T11:28:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958750-1842846814452913","game_id":"steam-4958750","kind":"announcement","title":"PROJE ARAF Demo – UI Overhaul & Improvements","summary":"A new update for PROJE ARAF Demo is now live! Based on recent feedback, we focused on enhancing the user interface and overall menu stability.Patch Notes:• UI Overhaul: Fixed overlapping UI elements in the Main Menu, specifically polishing the Settings and Credits panels.• Localization: Added integrated Turkish and English language switching in Settings.• Audio & Controls: Refined volume controls and persistence.• Visual & General Fixes: Updated store/library assets and performed stability tweak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T11:46:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452913","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958750-1839676055887368","game_id":"steam-4958750","kind":"announcement","title":"Inside the Red Room: A Glimpse into the Mind 👁️","summary":"What happens when subconscious boundaries collapse?We’ve just updated our Steam Store page with a brand-new teaser preview featuring the mysterious Red Room inside Dr. Vural's mind.Encrypted files, lost memories, and hidden clues await. Search every corner, but remember—don't trust everything you find.🎬 Check out the new gameplay trailer directly on our store page!🔗 Don’t forget to Add PROJE ARAF to your Steam Wishlist to support development!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T07:26:18Z","time_precision":"minute","sour